{"content":[{"c":["DOLEFUL CREATURE*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Designation for animal of uncertain identity in ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.13.21","r":"Isa.13.21","rawR":"Isa.13.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.13.21","value":"Isa.13.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Isaiah 13:21"}," (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), better rendered “howling creature” (",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). The context implies such beasts are unclean; hence, suggested creatures include the horned owl, hyena, jackal, and leopard. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Animals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Animals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Animals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Animals"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Birds_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Birds_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Birds_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Birds"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"DolefulCreature","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Isaiah 13:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.13.21","rawQueryValue":"Isa.13.21","sourceRefExact":"Isa.13.21"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"5f7d07bc4a67a6f12ba64bbe224206ae648bfd353689ea8801a8e17ac7e6c87e","sourceItemName":"DolefulCreature","sourceItemOrder":150,"sourceMember":"Articles/D.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"DolefulCreature","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Doleful Creature*","title":"Doleful Creature*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}